      "statement": "loadNextWorkout (src/lib/next-workout.ts) is the single shared function used by Home, the /workout/next planner, and session start to compute the upcoming workout's week, day, and per-slot exercise/prescription, including folding movement_adaptation rows for fluid programs with the same foldPrescription function the active session uses.",
